{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19847","headline":"感怀 七 · 孟郊","name":"感怀 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河梁莫相遇，草草不复言。\n汉家正离乱，王粲别荆蛮。\n野泽何萧条，悲风振空山。\n举头是星辰，念我何时还。\n亲爱久别散，形神各离迁。\n未爲生死诀，长在心目间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}